{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p032a","title":"曹髦自叙出生祯祥","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p032a-account","label":"《帝集》","text":"曹髦自叙出生祯祥","evidence":["shaodi-e-p032a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0068","role":"自叙","evidence":["shaodi-e-p032a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":241,"label":"正始〔二〕年九月二十五日乙未","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y241","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o012","basis":"正始〔二〕年九月二十五日乙未"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-p032a-q","shaodi-q-o012","shaodi-q-b-f56b355cff79244bd89c"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-p032a-q","source_order":[4,505,"P032a"],"order":1169}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0068","name":"曹髦","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-p032a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b9b09feaef71cfe4c7bf","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《帝集》载帝自叙始生祯祥，曰：“昔帝王之生，或有祯祥，盖所以彰显神异也。惟予小子，支胤末流，谬为灵祇之所相佑也；岂敢自比于前哲，聊记录以示后世焉。其辞曰：‘惟正始（三）〔二〕年，九月辛未朔，二十五日乙未直成，予生。于时也，天气清明，日月辉光；爰有黄气，烟煴于堂；照曜室宅，其色煌煌。相而论之曰：未者为土，魏之行也；厥日直成，应嘉名也；烟煴之气，神之精也；无灾无害，蒙神灵也。齐王不吊，颠覆厥度；群公受予，绍继祚皇。以眇眇之身，质性顽固；未能涉道，而遵大路；临深履冰，涕泗忧惧。古人有云，惧则不亡；伊予小子，曷敢怠荒？庶不忝辱，永奉丞尝。’”","attribution":"《帝集》","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":504,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d25eba0115fddcee9a0f","start":0,"end":273,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-f56b355cff79244bd89c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：正始二年（公元 241）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":62,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bf9ccbeb544f540e6afb","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o012","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33e60ac0c003858f0640","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，帝初通《论语》〖2〗。使太常以太牢祭孔子于辟雍〖3〗，以颜渊配〖4〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
